{"asset_key":"ep4/herohub_story_14411190","episode":"ep4","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"14411190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1441119001:1":{"text":"平民である私が警備隊に入り、隊長にまでなれたのは、とてつもなく幸運なことなんだ。","source_cn":"能从平民中被选拔为卫兵，再被选为卫队长是很幸运的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD908A69BFAE43AFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1441119002:1":{"text":"理由は分からないが、サリエ殿下は私を高く評価してくれている……彼が与えてくれたチャンスには感謝しているんだ。","source_cn":"沙利叶一直很看好我……虽然不清楚为什么，但我感谢他给我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB9539F65F14553B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1441119003:1":{"text":"平民が警備隊の選抜に参加できるようになったのも殿下のおかげだ。でなければ、私は王都で召使いとして働いていただろう。","source_cn":"如果不是他允许选拔平民成为卫兵，多给了平民一条路，现在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB95720BB3A0A96FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1441119003":{"text":"平民が警備隊の選抜に参加できるようになったのも殿下のおかげだ。でなければ、私は王都で召使いとして働いていただろう。","source_cn":"如果不是他允许选拔平民成为卫兵，多给了平民一条路，现在的我会是王城里一名普通的仆从。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB95720BB3A0A96FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1441119004:1":{"text":"ああ。応募できる年齢になれば、誰もが一度は挑戦するだろうな。","source_cn":"每个适龄的平民青年都不会放过这样的机会，要挤破头为自己...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C976DD8CAF80FBE","variant_status":"","male":"","fe